                <Pad Id="N3zEOrJijMwOtVOhj74oOn" Bounds="592,243,394,203" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Welcome, you made it to the guts of a Process node. Like described in the main patch a process can also have links assigned to either Update or Create (indicated by a gray or white link) and pads to store values.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Inputs and outputs for the Process node can be created from the node browser or by starting a link and clicking while holding CTRL.">
